        "created_at": "2014-08-19T16:42:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just wanted to ask this, as when we played with my friends the other night, one of them expressed interest in getting ahold of the game himself.&nbsp; So what is going to be going on with the promo power cards in this game?&nbsp; I know in sentinels card game that GTG made the fronts and back images avalable so that people could produce their own copies to use and after it's done they'll be releasing a collection of all the promos, with potentially differing art, so I figured I'd ask if this was going to be similar to the card game or go down a different path?</p>",
